 ## 0. One authority and explicit retirement
 
+### Seven-layer model distribution continuation — 2026-11-03
+
+The M09 [model release root and acquisition contract](specs/pon/CELL_MODEL_RELEASE_ROOT_V1.md)
+extends existing I05/I09 and PN3–PN5. TMR1 binds the unchanged complete TCD1 plan,
+explicit router roster and parent release roots; TCX1 verifies exact base/target
+chunk reuse in the original CAS. The existing finite multi-bootstrap directory
+uses bounded provenance/prefix diversity, and the original downloader adds
+session corruption isolation plus explicit, budgeted TCI1 rarest-first hints.
+The fresh TCA1 catalog composes complete release duties with the original physical
+retention arena and checks historical references before object reclamation.
+
+These are software interfaces and controlled tests, not new phases or activation.
+Original CURRENT, safe parser, resource and FinalUse owners remain mandatory.
+Actual release-level M12/Node funding composition, independently operated replicas,
+cross-owner installation/readback and preregistered WAN renewal/repair qualification
+remain separate exits. Hashes, directory hints and replica declarations do not
+prove independent custody or authorize release use.
+
 This is the one active engineering plan. It owns sequence, work boundaries and integration
 policy; the protocol suite owns domain rules and the module guides own implementation
 contracts. There is no parallel PoCO completion roadmap or separate Hepta blockchain.
